WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.001
Axiom by CaseZero
This is Axiom by CaseZero, built for the AI Agent Track and Case Study One. It is a governed dispute operating system for a five-person, non-technical bank complaints team. Axiom can prepare work in natural language, but it cannot invent authority, bypass a gate, or move money by itself.

2
00:00:18.001 --> 00:00:46.003
The clock starts before anyone understands the case.
The scenario bank serves one point eight million retail and SME customers. Today, one dispute takes about ninety minutes across email, documents, core banking, CRM and several departments. Eleven percent of regulatory deadlines are missed. Bank Negara Malaysia and FMOS timelines run from five to twenty working days. The problem is not a lack of chat. It is fragmented evidence, unclear ownership and slow controlled execution.

3
00:00:46.003 --> 00:01:14.004
Six agents propose. One kernel decides.
CaseZero uses six specialists for intake, classification, evidence verification, resolution, customer communication and SLA supervision. They can work in parallel and return typed proposals. A deterministic kernel owns the irreversible decisions. That boundary is the central innovation: models propose, the kernel disposes. It gives the speed of agents without granting a probabilistic model financial or compliance authority.

4
00:01:14.004 --> 00:01:34.004
Start with one live case, not a dashboard tour.
A new stakeholder gets one primary action: run a live complaint. The customer is fictional because a public judge link must never expose bank personal data. The execution is real. The page names that boundary before the click and keeps the staff workspace secondary until the case is understood.

5
00:01:34.004 --> 00:02:39.005
Click once. Wait for production proof.
This click provisions a fresh sanitized transaction and sends a real RFC eight-two-two complaint to the deployed FastAPI orchestrator. Nothing is marked complete while the request is running. The returned case reached COMMUNICATED after live Gemini calls, core and CRM tool evidence, a deterministic PASS-only gate, and a signed balanced reversal. The evidence rail shows the exact event sequence and hashes. The model writes language and classification proposals; it never receives posting authority. If any service fails, this page shows a failure instead of substituting rehearsal data.

6
00:02:39.005 --> 00:03:04.005
Only the exceptions need a person.
The simple workspace is designed for the complaints officer. It collapses the pipeline into the few cases that need a person. Each card carries category, urgency, deadline, evidence state and the next decision. Intake has already parsed RFC eight-two-two email and PDF evidence, applied a pre-model injection firewall, encrypted personal data and produced a deterministic extraction record.

7
00:03:04.005 --> 00:03:34.005
See the pressure before it becomes a breach.
Mission Control gives the stakeholder the operating picture. Cases move through a continuous state model; there is no hidden lane. The supervisor forecasts SLA pressure from deadlines and human workload. The view also exposes agent health and persisted evaluation results. Pro mode is denser for oversight, while mobile and Simple mode keep one active stage visible for day-to-day work.

8
00:03:34.005 --> 00:04:04.006
Ask. Inspect authority. Then act.
Axiom is agentic, but deliberately not magical. The operator asks to verify a case. Before anything runs, Axiom shows the named capability, whether the request changes state, the required role and every gate still in force. The server replans the command, checks the role, requires confirmation for governed changes and returns a receipt. Axiom has no direct posting capability. Money still requires PASS evidence and a signed kernel ticket.

9
00:04:04.006 --> 00:04:29.008
Trust the chain, not the screen.
The Audit Explorer verifies a continuous SHA-two-fifty-six chain. This rehearsal alters sequence four. The screen does not merely show a warning; it names the broken link and marks the derived view void. Injection attempts are quarantined before a model call, so hostile instructions never enter extraction or classification. Financial postings also require a balanced double-entry journal.

10
00:04:29.008 --> 00:04:54.009
Change the operation. Keep the controls visible.
Settings belong to the stakeholder, not to a hidden environment file. An Admin can change the bank display name, complaints contact, operating timezone, default workspace and SLA warning horizon. Axiom and automatic financial resolution have separate authority switches. Every change is server-validated and hash-chained. In rehearsal, the interface issues a receipt without changing the live register.

11
00:04:54.010 --> 00:05:19.011
One work email creates one least-privilege operator.
This is how bank staff add their emails. The first Admin is provisioned during the controlled deployment handoff. That Admin opens Operators, enters a colleague's work email, selects the least-privilege role and sends the invite through Supabase authentication. There is no open public registration. The rehearsal proves the flow without sending email or creating a real account.

12
00:05:19.011 --> 00:05:39.011
Measured, not merely demonstrated.
The persisted live-model evaluation scores ninety-five point nine percent category accuracy and ninety-eight point nine-seven percent urgency accuracy across one hundred and ninety-five clean cases. All five injection attacks are blocked. Median model latency is two point six seconds, measured cost is about one-tenth of a sen per case, and the release carries four hundred and sixty-six backend tests plus fourteen browser journeys.

13
00:05:39.011 --> 00:05:55.773
Ready for a synthetic pilot today.
The first controlled rollout targets unauthorised transactions and billing errors, together fifty-seven percent of scenario volume, with a stretch goal from ninety minutes to under five. CaseZero is ready for a synthetic pilot. Live rollout needs core and CRM credentials, the complaints mailbox, Compliance sign-off and the first Admin identity.
